# Satsuma_LX.mopconfig
# Satsuma LX (by Bosorkanamettle) is a full Satsuma overhaul: it replaces the body, interior,
# dashboard, lights and many bolted parts. MOP's Satsuma management (part toggling, bolt gluing on
# save, renderer culling, hood/battery/trigger fixes) was written for the vanilla car and fights the
# replaced parts; with MOPR 4.x this crashed the game on save.
#
# satsuma_ignore makes MOP - REVIVAL leave the Satsuma entirely to this mod: no fixes, no toggling,
# no physics changes, no renderer culling, no save-time gluing, no Satsuma save checks. The rest of
# the world (scenery, items, other vehicles, LODs, sectors) is still optimized as usual.
min_ver: 4.0.1
satsuma_ignore
